# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
.venv/
venv/
.python-version

# --- Tests / tooling ---
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# --- PyInstaller ---
# The spec files live in build/ (see plan 7.1), but PyInstaller's default
# workpath is also ./build. Ignore its output directories, keep the specs.
/build/*/
/dist/
*.manifest

# --- Qt generated ---
ui_*.py
*_rc.py
*.qmlc
*.jsc

# --- Erzeugte Dokumentation ---
# docs/*.md ist die Quelle, docs/pdf/ ist der Satz davon. Jederzeit neu
# erzeugbar mit tools/make_pdfs.py, und als Binärdatei in der Historie nur
# Rauschen - jede Textänderung wäre ein neues PDF.
/docs/pdf/

# --- MATLAB side of the repository ---
# Both branches of this repository carry a .gitignore, and this is the only
# file the two have in common. Identical content on both sides means the
# merge has nothing to resolve.
#
# The database rules are anchored to the root on purpose. The MATLAB side
# wrote a bare `*.db`, which reads harmlessly there and would swallow
# src/biofermentation/resources/SimulationAppDB_template.db over here — the
# one .db in this repository that is meant to be tracked.
/*.db
/Archiv/*.db
/figures/*.db
# Output of the MATLAB Compiler: 110 MB, reproducible at any time.
/BiofermentationSimulation/

# --- SQLite runtime artefacts ---
# The bundled template database IS tracked; only runtime files are ignored.
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.db-journal
*.backup.db
*.pre-migration.db
# Aus dem Template erzeugt, jederzeit reproduzierbar via db/repair.py
SimulationAppDB_verification.db

# --- Reference data (large MATLAB exports stay local unless small) ---
# tests/reference_data/*.csv.gz is tracked on purpose - it is the only proof
# that the port computes the same numbers.
#
# The database those exports were extracted FROM is not. 64 MB in a clone
# that nobody needs twice: the CSVs are the reference, the database is only
# how they were made (tests/reference_data/extract.py). It was removed from
# the history before the first push; keep your copy here and it stays out.
/additional_files/Thesis_SimulationAppDB.db

# --- macOS ---
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

# --- Windows ---
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# --- Editors ---
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
